"Standalone firewall deployments select reverse proxy or forward "
"authentication with ``--mode``. Their incident and reputation storage is "
"configured on the daemon command line. We use :ref:`edge-daemon-options` "
"for those flags and :ref:`edge-packaging` for service installation."
msgstr ""
